      "business_context": "The business question requires accurate yearly sales per product and location. Therefore, we ensure:\n1. All transaction dates are parsed consistently to allow year extraction.\n2. Product and store identifiers are unique and non\u2011null for correct joins.\n3. Quantities and prices are validated to prevent negative or zero values that would distort sales totals.\n4. String fields that influence product or location names are normalized (trim, case, diacritics removal) to avoid duplicate records due to formatting differences.\n5. Missing store_id values are forward\u2011filled from the most recent transaction to maintain continuity in location aggregation."
